{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30007_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:30a7abd437fc900438e512dd8572c822503e88a9f530bbc5baabcedab4967bf7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ceaed64511aa93bbe860cfff02418e6142e7e16685dcc2888d7b7dce52d3da19",
      "text": "从我开始对吧。我是秋山隼人！\n在High×Joker里担任吉他手！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:312db8af281a8f45bb5e827f57651c241ddbdc42b006dba3192b18322b47efe6",
      "text": "好的。我是Beit的渡边实。无论是在其他视频里\n认识我的，还是不认识我的，都请大家多多关照啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d964b77e08cccf8302d6a906a180734a3de77282b1725b5b5dbd671c65eafe7c",
      "text": "哟！我是神速一魂的红井朱雀！\n这次也要燃烧起来，Burning！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1c8fb2c15934e9f917a4ed8d067176a859fe706eda7ae1b5d4ec882db0030c1",
      "text": "下一个是我。木村龙，20岁！\n所属组合是FRAME！请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc37e880242084c52e9704c84d683dee3da8eaf1361bd2e6d2718c6af5b6b864",
      "text": "我是C.FIRST的眉见锐心。请多关照。\n以上5名成员将进行这次企划。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1a247c8978aea6a7bc62da5524d464369af2fa3f263896df1fb446378c48188",
      "text": "不管哪一组都一样，凑成了出乎意料的\n成员阵容呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2786a1f1adee72e54ea2cc5116835e3852e604a42d2c811dbd71eb272b2d6296",
      "text": "是啊。企划敲定的时候，会跟谁搭档呢，\n我们在FRAME里也聊过这个话题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6386e92c384fe12e4443072524e4be50fd26c5374ea7c081caf56254c6d1c783",
      "text": "虽然跨组合的工作至今为止也有过，\n但以这个阵容合作，恐怕还是第一次吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af23a2cbd38c4aaae4e811a408863f8cb4146d218e24e9d5c00518238a8b8a3a",
      "text": "经你这么一说，好像确实是！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54f3ac7ae3a889b8c0c5d258496b2345e8719b5e1adbcab9ef456fec8435f318",
      "text": "我有个提议。在开始企划之前，\n大家先稍微聊聊怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f195da3f3742be0ce7cfade04571c2eb44e8bb3fe9c44e96c3cef47f414f8ae",
      "text": "谈谈心里的想法，或者互相提问之类的。\n看视频的大家应该也很想听吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30007_01:1_3_30007_01_b:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c557bfb7e3562ba855a02dc75d782744c2a1a7abbfc47a6f37bec19bf054e767",
      "text": "那主意好，就这么办！从知道是这个阵容\n起，我就有想问的事情了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
